# Questions to Dan

Dan has ADHD. If you need a decision from him, do not ask in a paragraph.

- One decision per chunk.
- Short bullets — one idea each.
- Label the kind of ask: pick one / yes-no / optional.
- Put the question first, not after a long explanation.
- Default and keep going when a wrong guess is cheap. Ask only when the wrong path is expensive or irreversible.
